From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: computerguy526 <355510486+computerguy526@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 17 Nov 2026 15:09:13 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] kosmickrisp: gpusafe: guard buffers per device

The clamp counter and the loop-state chunks belong to the device whose
residency set holds them (kk_device::safe_pool, created on first use, freed
at device destroy). Two live devices each have their own, so a second device
is neither refused loop states nor left without the clamp; the watchdog sums
the counters of all pools. KK_OOM_MAX and KK_OOM_WINDOW_S accept 0 again
(0 = the window's size / no window), as before the strict parsing.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_compiler.m         |   5 +-
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_device.h            |   3 +
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_safety.c            | 241 ++++++++++--------
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_safety.h            |   8 +-
 src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_safety_core.h       |  20 --
 .../vulkan/tests/kk_safety_core2_test.c       |  15 +-
 6 files changed, 141 insertions(+), 151 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_compiler.m b/src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_compiler.m
index 9ce0322..01d7ae5 100644
--- a/src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_compiler.m
+++ b/src/kosmickrisp/bridge/mtl_compiler.m
@@ -225,8 +225,9 @@ kk_flush_segment(const char *why, bool wait)
          NSError *error = nil;
          double t0 = kk_now_ms();
          NSURL *url = [NSURL fileURLWithPath:[NSString stringWithUTF8String:tmp]];
-         /* The data reaches the disk before the name does: a segment under its final name is
-          * never empty or cut short after a crash or power loss. */
+         /* The data is handed to the drive before the name exists: a segment under its final
+          * name is not empty or cut short after the process or the system crashes. (No
+          * F_FULLFSYNC: it would stall the compile lock for a guarantee against power loss only.) */
          bool written = [kk_serializer serializeAsArchiveAndFlushToURL:url error:&error];
          if (written) {
             int fd = open(tmp, O_RDONLY);
diff --git a/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_device.h b/src/kosmickrisp/vulkan/kk_device.h
